<!doctype lake><title>🦅 𝓔𝓪𝓰𝓵𝓮</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="MBRa0" id="MBRa0" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ua61366f9" id="ua61366f9">🍀</span><span data-lake-id="u85d0e2b7" id="u85d0e2b7"> 𝐅𝐚𝐬𝐭 𝐈𝐧𝐟𝐞𝐫𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐞 𝐟𝐫𝐨𝐦 𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐧𝐬𝐟𝐨𝐫𝐦𝐞𝐫𝐬 𝐯𝐢𝐚 𝐒𝐩𝐞𝐜𝐮𝐥𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐯𝐞 𝐃𝐞𝐜𝐨𝐝𝐢𝐧𝐠</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u218ba748" id="u218ba748"><strong><span data-lake-id="u554b52c5" id="u554b52c5">大型自回归模型，尤其是大型 Transformer，相较于规模较小的模型具有更强的能力。然而，这些大模型执行单个解码步骤所需的时间显著高于小模型；更为不利的是，这些步骤以串行方式执行——解码 </span></strong><em><strong><span data-lake-id="u35729a03" id="u35729a03">K</span></strong></em><strong><span data-lake-id="uf1b9a7cd" id="uf1b9a7cd"> 个 token 需要串行运行模型 </span></strong><em><strong><span data-lake-id="ufcbebdce" id="ufcbebdce">K</span></strong></em><strong><span data-lake-id="ub2d8446d" id="ub2d8446d"> 次。鉴于大型自回归模型，特别是大型 Transformer 的重要性，已有研究提出多种加速其推理的方法</span></strong></p><ul list="uce560625"><li fid="uef3d06a5" data-lake-id="uf8f1d14e" id="uf8f1d14e"><span data-lake-id="u0080a7f0" id="u0080a7f0">一类方法则源于以下观察：并非所有推理步骤都具有相同的难度——某些步骤需要规模很大的模型，而另一些步骤则可以由效率更高的模型较好地近似。这些自适应计算方法旨在为较简单的推理步骤使用更少的计算资源</span></li><li fid="uef3d06a5" data-lake-id="u6a00ab09" id="u6a00ab09"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6e2c54f7" id="u6e2c54f7" style="color: #DF2A3F">尽管其中许多方案已被证明在实践中非常有效，但它们通常需要修改模型架构、改变训练流程并重新训练模型，而且无法保持输出完全一致</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf13bbddc" id="uf13bbddc"><strong><span data-lake-id="u83abef3f" id="u83abef3f">上述关于推理步骤存在难易之分的关键观察，也是本研究的重要动机。作者进一步观察到，大模型推理的瓶颈往往不在于算术运算，而在于内存带宽和通信，因此仍可能存在可用的额外计算资源</span></strong></p><ul list="u2861d9b8"><li fid="u074c36e1" data-lake-id="u49bfd6c0" id="u49bfd6c0"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua2fac2da" id="ua2fac2da" style="color: #5C0036">基于此，提出将提高并发度作为自适应调整计算量的互补方法。具体而言，能够在不改变模型架构、不改变训练流程或要求重新训练模型、也不改变模型输出分布的前提下，加速模型推理。这一目标通过投机执行得以实现</span></strong></li><li fid="u074c36e1" data-lake-id="u6981ca71" id="u6981ca71"><span data-lake-id="uc40b26a1" id="uc40b26a1">投机执行是一种常见于处理器的优化技术：在执行某项任务的同时，并行验证该任务是否确有必要，从而提高并发度。分支预测是投机执行的一个典型例子。要使投机执行有效，就需要一种高效机制，用于提出很可能实际需要执行的任务</span></li><li fid="u074c36e1" data-lake-id="uf4b8c6f8" id="uf4b8c6f8"><span data-lake-id="u757e0ba8" id="u757e0ba8">在本文中，将投机执行推广至随机情形，即某项任务以一定概率需要执行的情形。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u897984f8" id="u897984f8" style="color: #5C0036">将这一思想应用于 Transformer 等自回归模型的解码时，从效率更高的近似模型中采样生成序列，并将其作为速度较慢的目标模型的投机前缀</span></strong></li><li fid="u074c36e1" data-lake-id="ud31061fe" id="ud31061fe"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub243732d" id="ub243732d" style="color: #5C0036">借助一种称为投机采样的新型采样方法，最大化这些投机任务被接受的概率，同时保证系统输出与单独使用目标模型时的输出具有相同的分布</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub51ec666" id="ub51ec666" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1791076664033-f6f64984-9eab-4288-a580-07eee7dd6d45.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u20d2df6a-a112-4f46-9997-1582a3be2f4%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u7011d426-6706-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A902.4000244140625%2C%22height%22%3A241%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A117308%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1228%2C%22originHeight%22%3A328%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%2COR1.5PERCENT%2CTO10%2C989%2C79INLATEMORNINGTRADING%3A%5BEND%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A583%2C%22y%22%3A282%2C%22width%22%3A620%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22POINTS%2COR1.5PERCENT%3ATOLE%22%2C%22x%22%3A518%2C%22y%22%3A184%2C%22width%22%3A314%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%3A%2COR1%3A5PERCENT%3ATO10%3A989%3A79INTEYE%22%2C%22x%22%3A586%2C%22y%22%3A251%2C%22width%22%3A424%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%3AOR1%2C5PERCENT%2CTO1098G%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A592%2C%22y%22%3A217%2C%22width%22%3A309%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%5BSTART%5DJAPANSBENCHMARKNIK%22%2C%22x%22%3A14%2C%22y%22%3A116%2C%22width%22%3A271%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OSE226%2C69POINTS%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A416%2C%22y%22%3A286%2C%22width%22%3A198%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KNIKKEI225INDEXRO%22%2C%22x%22%3A238%2C%22y%22%3A115%2C%22width%22%3A192%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%5BSTART%5DJAPANSBENCHMARK%22%2C%22x%22%3A11%2C%22y%22%3A150%2C%22width%22%3A245%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%5DJAPANSBENCHMARKNIK%22%2C%22x%22%3A66%2C%22y%22%3A84%2C%22width%22%3A221%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NIKKEI22R%22%2C%22x%22%3A247%2C%22y%22%3A49%2C%22width%22%3A114%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RO5E226%3A69Z%22%2C%22x%22%3A407%2C%22y%22%3A117%2C%22width%22%3A141%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RT%5DJAPANSBENCHMARKNIKKE%22%2C%22x%22%3A47%2C%22y%22%3A51%2C%22width%22%3A260%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KNIKKEI2Z5INDEX%22%2C%22x%22%3A244%2C%22y%22%3A83%2C%22width%22%3A164%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22226%3A69%22%2C%22x%22%3A449%2C%22y%22%3A184%2C%22width%22%3A74%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%5DJAPAN'%22%2C%22x%22%3A68%2C%22y%22%3A218%2C%22width%22%3A85%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BENCHMARK%22%2C%22x%22%3A164%2C%22y%22%3A17%2C%22width%22%3A90%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BENCHMA%22%2C%22x%22%3A166%2C%22y%22%3A254%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SBENCHMARK%22%2C%22x%22%3A132%2C%22y%22%3A186%2C%22width%22%3A120%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SBENCHMAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A139%2C%22y%22%3A218%2C%22width%22%3A103%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%5BSTART%5DJAPAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A12%2C%22y%22%3A185%2C%22width%22%3A130%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SPOINTSOR%22%2C%22x%22%3A514%2C%22y%22%3A151%2C%22width%22%3A151%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROSE22569P%22%2C%22x%22%3A407%2C%22y%22%3A151%2C%22width%22%3A139%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROSE22%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A405%2C%22y%22%3A83%2C%22width%22%3A93%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22226.%22%2C%22x%22%3A449%2C%22y%22%3A219%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%5BSTART%22%2C%22x%22%3A15%2C%22y%22%3A218%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22225INDE%3E%22%2C%22x%22%3A311%2C%22y%22%3A287%2C%22width%22%3A88%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%5BSTART%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A16%2C%22y%22%3A253%2C%22width%22%3A58%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22.69POINT%22%2C%22x%22%3A484%2C%22y%22%3A253%2C%22width%22%3A98%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%5BSTART%5DI%22%2C%22x%22%3A16%2C%22y%22%3A84%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22START%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A17%2C%22y%22%3A50%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ZPOINTS%22%2C%22x%22%3A531%2C%22y%22%3A118%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NIKKEI%22%2C%22x%22%3A260%2C%22y%22%3A185%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SBENCHMARK%22%2C%22x%22%3A155%2C%22y%22%3A287%2C%22width%22%3A109%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NIKKEI2%22%2C%22x%22%3A246%2C%22y%22%3A150%2C%22width%22%3A87%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22IKKE%22%2C%22x%22%3A266%2C%22y%22%3A219%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ZZ5INDEX%22%2C%22x%22%3A315%2C%22y%22%3A150%2C%22width%22%3A98%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22START%22%2C%22x%22%3A19%2C%22y%22%3A17%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NIKKEI%22%2C%22x%22%3A262%2C%22y%22%3A254%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22IINDEX%22%2C%22x%22%3A348%2C%22y%22%3A219%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NIIKKEI%22%2C%22x%22%3A256%2C%22y%22%3A286%2C%22width%22%3A64%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22POINTS%22%2C%22x%22%3A520%2C%22y%22%3A218%2C%22width%22%3A66%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KBENDN%22%2C%22x%22%3A244%2C%22y%22%3A17%2C%22width%22%3A69%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%5DJAPANS%22%2C%22x%22%3A64%2C%22y%22%3A18%2C%22width%22%3A98%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22226.%22%2C%22x%22%3A444%2C%22y%22%3A253%2C%22width%22%3A58%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22JAPAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A70%2C%22y%22%3A288%2C%22width%22%3A80%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2225%22%2C%22x%22%3A324%2C%22y%22%3A184%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22STARTI%22%2C%22x%22%3A18%2C%22y%22%3A286%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22JAPAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A72%2C%22y%22%3A254%2C%22width%22%3A68%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROSE%22%2C%22x%22%3A412%2C%22y%22%3A254%2C%22width%22%3A43%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INDEX%22%2C%22x%22%3A355%2C%22y%22%3A186%2C%22width%22%3A49%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INDEX%22%2C%22x%22%3A347%2C%22y%22%3A255%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22225%22%2C%22x%22%3A316%2C%22y%22%3A254%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OSE%22%2C%22x%22%3A418%2C%22y%22%3A186%2C%22width%22%3A27%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22225%22%2C%22x%22%3A323%2C%22y%22%3A219%2C%22width%22%3A33%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22.69%22%2C%22x%22%3A483%2C%22y%22%3A218%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23efefef%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u32a2f152%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ued517aa1" id="ued517aa1"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub6ce7fe7" id="ub6ce7fe7">本方法易于应用于实际生产环境，无需训练新模型，也不会改变输出。在内存带宽构成瓶颈且仍有可用计算资源的常见场景中，它可能是加速 Transformer 等自回归模型采样的一种合适的默认方案。综上，本文的主要贡献为</span></strong></p><ul list="u44ad4b20"><li fid="uf5e47e54" data-lake-id="ud88d830c" id="ud88d830c"><span data-lake-id="u86ade84a" id="u86ade84a">将投机执行推广至随机情形，并提出一种新的采样方法，称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u2b6bc12f" id="u2b6bc12f">投机采样</span></strong></li><li fid="uf5e47e54" data-lake-id="u5f2198a1" id="u5f2198a1"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5828739e" id="u5828739e" style="color: #5C0036">提出一种称为投机解码的解码机制，能够在不改变模型架构、训练方式和输出分布的前提下，加速自回归模型的解码</span></strong></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="RqGgg" id="RqGgg" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="uea7141ca" id="uea7141ca">🌿 𝐒𝐩𝐞𝐜𝐮𝐥𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐯𝐞 𝐃𝐞𝐜𝐨𝐝𝐢𝐧𝐠</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u2dc6ecfd" id="u2dc6ecfd"><strong><span data-lake-id="udd544a7f" id="udd544a7f">设</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M_p%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe0e02ee0bb1d8d55da31fac52c4462a0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GVk9C%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u25eb03aa" id="u25eb03aa">为希望加速其推理的目标模型，</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(x_t%5C%5Cmid%20x_%7B%3Ct%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff899c956aadb7a4393e3efa23950d7f7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nabnU%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u63a38af3" id="u63a38af3">表示该模型在给定前缀</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_%7B%3Ct%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa28f1b5009a73e46747d95dfb4c10740.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22C3Xb2%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ucbdd66cc" id="ucbdd66cc">时输出的概率分布。设</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M_q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9608bde788894bb1869619372510097e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22S06ij%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub10a896a" id="ub10a896a">为针对同一任务、效率更高的近似模型，并用 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_t%5C%5Cmid%20x_%7B%3Ct%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F05d66c1197c0d071b43d744d2a2d9c31.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Hfnsf%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u81bab516" id="u81bab516">表示该模型在给定前缀</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_%7B%3Ct%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa28f1b5009a73e46747d95dfb4c10740.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Cr8P8%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u7e3b7190" id="u7e3b7190"> 时输出的概率分布。核心思想是</span></strong></p><ul list="uf828ecee"><li fid="u416d8744" data-lake-id="u43f99669" id="u43f99669"><span data-lake-id="u1f71bbff" id="u1f71bbff">利用效率更高的模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M_q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9608bde788894bb1869619372510097e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22urVHC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7370640d" id="u7370640d">生成</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BZ%7D%5E%7B%2B%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6fecd452b6fb7519b03b5f92ab42fe53.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UBxvg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud61b1bb4" id="ud61b1bb4">个候选 token</span></li><li fid="u416d8744" data-lake-id="uda33af72" id="uda33af72"><span data-lake-id="u2271b15d" id="u2271b15d">利用目标模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M_p%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe0e02ee0bb1d8d55da31fac52c4462a0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UIcta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4acc4ea8" id="u4acc4ea8">并行评估所有候选词元及其在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M_q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9608bde788894bb1869619372510097e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zT4pQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u64888ef5" id="u64888ef5">下的对应概率，接受其中能够保持输出分布不变的候选</span></li><li fid="u416d8744" data-lake-id="u9e40fca8" id="u9e40fca8"><span data-lake-id="u4bece6ed" id="u4bece6ed">从调整后的分布中额外采样一个词元，以修正第一个被拒绝的候选，或者在所有候选均被接受时，额外添加一个词元</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2e532fa2" id="u2e532fa2"><strong><span data-lake-id="u47829b77" id="u47829b77" style="color: #DF2A3F">通过这种方式，目标模型</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M_p%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe0e02ee0bb1d8d55da31fac52c4462a0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nkArE%22%7D" style="color: #DF2A3F"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ue5e92d64" id="ue5e92d64" style="color: #DF2A3F">每次并行运行都至少产生一个新 token。因此，即使在最坏情况下，目标模型的串行运行次数也不会超过简单自回归方法所需的次数。同时，每次运行也可能产生多个新 token，最多为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma%2B1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb1335814ec53f422c6e5493b3d51ce9f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Stv3J%22%7D" style="color: #DF2A3F"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ueaf9ee99" id="ueaf9ee99" style="color: #DF2A3F">个，具体取决于</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M_q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9608bde788894bb1869619372510097e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22U0o3m%22%7D" style="color: #DF2A3F"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud18696b9" id="ud18696b9" style="color: #DF2A3F">对</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M_p%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe0e02ee0bb1d8d55da31fac52c4462a0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KJ7X4%22%7D" style="color: #DF2A3F"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uf2998805" id="uf2998805" style="color: #DF2A3F">的近似程度</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u3803fbf7" id="u3803fbf7"><strong><span data-lake-id="ucc6512b5" id="ucc6512b5" style="color: #00346B">投机采样：为获得服从</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F01a43d844d20cf8c9a4edce9ccb6c442.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GFfiq%22%7D" style="color: #00346B"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u3cb2dba3" id="u3cb2dba3" style="color: #00346B">的样本，即</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%5C%5Csim%20p(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8a35f6f3193077c968506db65b883445.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lk6PF%22%7D" style="color: #00346B"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u93ace308" id="u93ace308" style="color: #00346B">，改为先从</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa28d90a765883cf834a7e983e31d2b6c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22puw7X%22%7D" style="color: #00346B"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u46818f0b" id="u46818f0b" style="color: #00346B">中采样，即</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%5C%5Csim%20q(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffa4095816c8deec5ad025a04703857a5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZU8po%22%7D" style="color: #00346B"></card></p><ul list="uc31253d3"><li fid="u26adde82" data-lake-id="u1c64bc04" id="u1c64bc04"><span data-lake-id="ud26c5744" id="ud26c5744">如果</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x)%5C%5Cleq%20p(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F267f77b190374fe5bccf89936ee47d4d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ieL1n%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u00759da6" id="u00759da6">，则保留该样本；如果</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x)%3Ep(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4f8b7561a268b2ea9468c37b9a089af2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22U8irN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc2ce908b" id="uc2ce908b">，则以</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%221-%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp(x)%7D%7Bq(x)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F52e031f023d13ca7ddfe2238d8d8bdf5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22l1uCc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud36b925a" id="ud36b925a">的概率拒绝该样本，并改为从下面经过调整的分布中重新采样</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uec74479d" id="uec74479d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D(x)%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bnorm%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmax%5C%5Cleft(0%2Cp(x)-q(x)%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2397539f82ce6eb7918006b953f68be1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ClBKI%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u06be343b"><li fid="ud732c415" data-lake-id="u44792711" id="u44792711"><span data-lake-id="u928f6d15" id="u928f6d15">对于任意概率分布 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F01a43d844d20cf8c9a4edce9ccb6c442.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yJ9GW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua683a4cc" id="ua683a4cc"> 和 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa28d90a765883cf834a7e983e31d2b6c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jtPW7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9375b4a3" id="u9375b4a3">，通过上述方式采样得到的 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F712ecf7894348e92d8779c3ee87eeeb0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DMJe5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua6d07acd" id="ua6d07acd"> 确实满足 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%5C%5Csim%20p(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8a35f6f3193077c968506db65b883445.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZtxTM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc282e478" id="uc282e478">​</span></li><li fid="ud732c415" data-lake-id="u3b753342" id="u3b753342"><span data-lake-id="u0fa3c5b5" id="u0fa3c5b5">给定将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M_q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9608bde788894bb1869619372510097e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FbrKp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u02c2406a" id="u02c2406a">应用于条件前缀</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bprefix%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbb23ce4692eecbd44c516bb2421b6ff4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Hbe41%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf6e59020" id="uf6e59020">所得到的分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa28d90a765883cf834a7e983e31d2b6c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FhTJC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7314c347" id="u7314c347">，可以采样一个词元</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_1%5C%5Csim%20q(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F244a06a14673447655c86b43a38ac161.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IrP2b%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u457f25b0" id="u457f25b0">。随后，将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M_p%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe0e02ee0bb1d8d55da31fac52c4462a0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kiipq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u62112524" id="u62112524">应用于 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bprefix%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbb23ce4692eecbd44c516bb2421b6ff4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fhTTd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7737ce95" id="u7737ce95">，以计算分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F01a43d844d20cf8c9a4edce9ccb6c442.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22h2NnN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udf610de8" id="udf610de8">；与此同时，投机地将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M_p%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe0e02ee0bb1d8d55da31fac52c4462a0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bN24e%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0487ae3b" id="u0487ae3b">应用于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bprefix%7D%2B%5Bx_1%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F95f9c8b2613e29fb8cf590b4a8b415a3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22o7Pbg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc6ae2dfb" id="uc6ae2dfb">，并行计算下一个词元</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb526050a1759d2db5c1ae7e883a48312.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TjekG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u88677e97" id="u88677e97">的概率分布</span></li><li fid="ud732c415" data-lake-id="u0c46045f" id="u0c46045f"><span data-lake-id="u9c9ee304" id="u9c9ee304">待两项计算均完成后，按照上述规则进行处理：如果</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0e8831d88c93179dbe6c8b5e3678ca20.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VwU5M%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u05384983" id="u05384983">被拒绝，则丢弃针对 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb526050a1759d2db5c1ae7e883a48312.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MrnfH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0cae1003" id="u0cae1003"> 的计算结果，并从调整后的分布中重新采样</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0e8831d88c93179dbe6c8b5e3678ca20.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22O3mUc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8988912d" id="u8988912d">；如果 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0e8831d88c93179dbe6c8b5e3678ca20.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VScIj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9e6276d5" id="u9e6276d5"> 被接受，则保留这两个词元。算法 1 将这一思想推广为一次采样 1 至 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma%2B1%5Cn%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9b22e6f04e56937527b10b17588d5edb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MuBJf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc79098aa" id="uc79098aa"> 个词元</span></li></ul>